{"3588820": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Human May Jump", "steam_appid": 3588820, "required_age": 0, "is_free": false, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vision:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, there are no vicious enemies, complex puzzles, swords, or sorcery. Your superhuman leg strength is your only tool—forge your path upward, one leap at a time, to scale heights no one has ever conquered!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charge to Jump:</strong> Hold the jump button to build power—the longer the press, the mightier the leap!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim &amp; Launch:</strong> Push the left stick to align your direction, then release the button to launch toward the camera’s viewpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Mid-Air Tricks:</strong> Once airborne, movement control locks—commit fully to every jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Rules:</strong> Master timing and camera angles. A single miscalculation in pressure or aim could undo all progress! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588820/extras/cb6b0d9bb40f646fd134fe646c008606.poster.avif?t=1759833932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588820/extras/cb6b0d9bb40f646fd134fe646c008606.webm?t=1759833932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Vision:</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >In this world, there are no vicious enemies, complex puzzles, swords, or sorcery. Your superhuman leg strength is your only tool—forge your path upward, one leap at a time, to scale heights no one has ever conquered!</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Gameplay:</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Charge to Jump:</strong> Hold the jump button to build power—the longer the press, the mightier the leap!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Aim &amp; Launch:</strong> Push the left stick to align your direction, then release the button to launch toward the camera’s viewpoint.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>No Mid-Air Tricks:</strong> Once airborne, movement control locks—commit fully to every jump!</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Precision Rules:</strong> Master timing and camera angles. A single miscalculation in pressure or aim could undo all progress! </p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline crossorigin=\"anonymous\" poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588820/extras/cb6b0d9bb40f646fd134fe646c008606.poster.avif?t=1759833932\" width=800 height=450 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588820/extras/cb6b0d9bb40f646fd134fe646c008606.webm?t=1759833932\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p>", "short_description": "Here comes another intense 3D platformer challenge! The longer you charge, the higher you leap! Reach the peak to conquer levels! But beware: No takebacks on jumps! Master your timing - a single misstep could send you back to the start!", "supported_languages": "English", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588820/fbc9330ebaf32f69f7c07d781e6e7e67bc7fcc00/header.jpg?t=1759833932", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3588820/c0a6657b8355ed2c0123d556951ef90c5607f1b5/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1759833932", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steams